@startuml

[*] --> Off

Off --> Initializing : IsRequested OR IsRequester
Off --> On : HeartBeat received\nAND value <= Power Down threshold
Off --> Pending_Shutdown : HeartBeat received\nAND value > Power Down threshold

Initializing --> Off : NOT IsRequested\nAND NOT IsRequester\n(no longer monitored)
Initializing --> On : HeartBeat received\nAND value <= Power Down threshold
Initializing --> Pending_Shutdown : HeartBeat received\nAND value > Power Down threshold
Initializing --> Faulted : DTC timeout elapsed\n(no HeartBeat received)

On --> Pending_Shutdown : HeartBeat received\nAND value > Power Down threshold
On --> Reboot : HeartBeat received\nAND value < penultimate HeartBeat value
On --> Off : DTC timeout elapsed\nAND NOT IsRequested\nAND NOT IsRequester
On --> Faulted : DTC timeout elapsed\nAND (IsRequested OR IsRequester)

Pending_Shutdown --> Reboot : HeartBeat received\nAND value < penultimate HeartBeat value
Pending_Shutdown --> Off : DTC timeout elapsed\nAND NOT IsRequested\nAND NOT IsRequester
Pending_Shutdown --> Faulted : DTC timeout elapsed\nAND (IsRequested OR IsRequester)

Reboot --> Pending_Shutdown : HeartBeat received\nAND value > Power Down threshold
Reboot --> On : HeartBeat received\nAND value > penultimate HeartBeat value\n(correctly increasing)
Reboot --> Off : DTC timeout elapsed\nAND NOT IsRequested\nAND NOT IsRequester
Reboot --> Faulted : DTC timeout elapsed\nAND (IsRequested OR IsRequester)

Faulted --> Off : NOT IsRequested\nAND NOT IsRequester\n(no longer monitored)
Faulted --> Pending_Shutdown : HeartBeat received\nAND value > Power Down threshold
Faulted --> On : HeartBeat received\nAND value > penultimate HeartBeat value\n(correctly increasing)
Faulted --> Reboot : HeartBeat received\nAND value < penultimate HeartBeat value

@enduml
